  "a061a23f-6abf-484f-9bad-8516c48e2c6d"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "gives the Association from the name of each relation of ",
 StyleBox["structure", "TI"],
 " to its arity, the number of arguments ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["Obstruction"]], "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/Obstruction", 
    "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "b8c53e35-2e8c-4a7e-8082-a9c14f23fb15"],
